<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 40 bln levs 12-mth T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 40 bln levs 12-mth T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer on Monday 40 billion levs ($23.2 million) of 12-month discount T-bills with no minimum acceptable price set in advance, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>Details of the offer follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3040797006</p>
<p> Maturity		 12 months</p>
<p> Par value		40 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   June 30</p>
<p> Issue date	     July 1</p>
<p> Maturity date	  June 30, 1998</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188 ($ = 1722 Bulgarian Levs)</p>
